#: src/postulo/plugins/wikidata/__init__.py
msgid "Fetch a company's names in other languages, and where it is, from its Wikidata item, when you press for it: one request to www.wikidata.org for that one item, which tells Wikidata which organisation you are looking at. Wikidata's data is CC0. Switched off, nothing is fetched; the names and places already kept stay."
msgstr "Ġib l-ismijiet ta' kumpanija f'lingwi oħra, u fejn tinsab, mill-element Wikidata tagħha, meta titlob dan: talba waħda lil www.wikidata.org għal dak l-element wieħed, li tgħid lil Wikidata liema organizzazzjoni qed tħares lejha. Id-data ta' Wikidata hija CC0. Meta jkun mitfi, xejn ma jinġieb; l-ismijiet u l-postijiet diġà miżmuma jibqgħu."

#: src/postulo/plugins/wikidata/__init__.py
msgid "Wikidata"
msgstr "Wikidata"
